{"t":"Rest in Hallowed Ground Quest","s":"rest-in-hallowed-ground-quest-34a71","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Rest in Hallowed Ground Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Holy Water Quest</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(25+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 11, 2007<br/>Christmas Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p class=\"no-results\">This quest has no legend.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf\">Wolves</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poachers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wisp\">Wisps</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Health%20Potion\">Health Potions</a>, 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Travel money</li>\n<li>Completed <a href=\"#/quest/the-white-raven-monastery-quest\">The White Raven Monastery Quest</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>Ask <a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">Temple</a> for a mission. She will ask you to bring her a <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">vial of holy water</a> from the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hpdGVfUmF2ZW5fTW9uYXN0ZXJ5P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"White Raven Monastery (page does not exist)\">White Raven Monastery</span>. Travel to the Isle of Kings and ask <a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a> about holy water and tell him <a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a> sent you.\n</p><p>Take the <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">water</a> back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>. She will ask you to put some on every grave in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul%20Hill\">Unholy Cemetery</a>, north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33196,31695,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33196, 31695, 7)</a>). Be prepared to face <a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poachers</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a> on your way, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a> on the cemetery.\n</p><p>Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Special%20Flask%20%28Holy%20Water%29\">vial</a> on every grave there. There are 15 graves, after using all graves, your <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">vial</a> will be empty. Report back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a> to get your reward.\n</p><p><i>You see a <a href=\"#/wiki/Package%20of%20Potions\">package of potions</a>. It weighs 36.00 oz. It contains 5 health and 5 mana potions.</i>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: Welcome to the temple of Banor's blood <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: Well, I would do it myself but I can't leave town for a longer time. Would you be so kind to bring me a vial of holy water from the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hpdGVfUmF2ZW5fTW9uYXN0ZXJ5P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"White Raven Monastery (page does not exist)\">white raven monastery</span>?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: I thank you a lot in advance. The power of the holy water from the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hpdGVfUmF2ZW5fTW9uYXN0ZXJ5P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"White Raven Monastery (page does not exist)\">white raven monastery</span> is legendary. For my task it is indispensable. We talk about that when you get back.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rest in Hallowed Ground Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a> on <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a>: Welcome, <i>Player</i>! Feel free to tell me what has brought you here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Holy water</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a>: Who are you to demand holy water from the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvV2hpdGVfUmF2ZW5fTW9uYXN0ZXJ5P2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"White Raven Monastery (page does not exist)\">white raven monastery</span>? Who sent you??<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a></b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Costello\">Costello</a>: Ohh, why didn't you tell that before? Sure you get some holy water if it is for <a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>! Here you are.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rest in Hallowed Ground Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: Welcome to the temple of Banor's blood <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: Have you heard about the unholy graveyard north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>? Go there and spill some holy water on every grave. Once you are done, come back tome.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rest in Hallowed Ground Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: Welcome to the temple of Banor's blood <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Mission</b><br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Amanda\">Amanda</a>: I appreciate your help. May Banor be always on your side. Here, your reward is this package which contains five mana and five health potions.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Rest in Hallowed Ground Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["the-white-raven-monastery-quest"]}